        "TileImage": "$($repository 856b2aa2-e224-48c3-b890-01fdf4dba6de).Image",
        "Description": "Good Morning 47.\rICA have recieved clear instruction to elimate the following targets all by means of appearing as an accident, specifically of the wet kind-\r\rFirst up we have Helen West. ICA have managed to track down her secret recipe, and the muffins she plans to sell are far from safe.\r\rVanda McMurry, A social influencer, who seems to like Janus a little too much-\r\rFinally, Lance Gerken, we have a peeping tom on our hands 47. I&apos;d suggest putting his head back where it belongs.\rGood luck, 47.",
